    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6adb8797edfb83.28739427\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Four new titles are awarded to players for completing various achievements in Talebound!<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/guide/talebound-overview-rewards\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Talebound Guide</span><span class=\"wh-button-icon zam-button-icon\"><img src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_dungeon_waycrestmannor.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></a></div><br><br>Talebound is a new standalone game mode in Patch 12.1.7. Players will pick one of three classes and go on a roguelite adventure starting in the town of Quillgrave. Here you'll find the Storyteller!<br><br>Three of these titles are earned by completing Mythic difficulty on each of the three classes, while the last title is earned by completing all the stories from the Storyteller.<ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><a class=\"icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"achievement\" data-entity=\"achievement\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/ptr/achievement=63813/mythic-the-inquisitors-final-confrontation\"><img alt=\"Mythic: The Inquisitor's Final Confrontation\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_arathorhandtorch01.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Mythic: The Inquisitor's Final Confrontation</span></a> now awards the title <a data-entity=\"title\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/ptr/title/of-the-sacred-flame-1361\"><span class=\"tinyicontxt\">%s of the Sacred Flame</span></a></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><a class=\"icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"achievement\" data-entity=\"achievement\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/ptr/achievement=63805/mythic-the-slayers-final-confrontation\"><img alt=\"Mythic: The Slayer's Final Confrontation\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_armor_witchhunter_c_01.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Mythic: The Slayer's Final Confrontation</span></a> now awards the title <a data-entity=\"title\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/ptr/title/monster-hunter-1358\"><span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Monster Hunter %s</span></a></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><a class=\"icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"achievement\" data-entity=\"achievement\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/ptr/achievement=63809/mythic-the-witchs-final-confrontation\"><img alt=\"Mythic: The Witch's Final Confrontation\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchanting_815_drustrod.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Mythic: The Witch's Final Confrontation</span></a> now awards the title <a data-entity=\"title\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/ptr/title/of-the-crooked-path-1357\"><span class=\"tinyicontxt\">%s of the Crooked Path</span></a></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><a class=\"icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"achievement\" data-entity=\"achievement\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/ptr/achievement=64139/stories-to-share\"><img alt=\"Stories to Share\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bookmountdrust.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Stories to Share</span></a> now awards the title <a data-entity=\"title\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/ptr/title/listener-1359\"><span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Listener %s</span></a></div></li></ul>We don't know much about Talebound, as it has not been tested on the Patch 12.1.7 PTR. It's unclear exactly how hard Mythic difficulty will be until the game mode is tested or goes live. If you want to check out the Talebound Talent tree, make sure to <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/talebound-talent-calculator\" data-contiguous=\"true\">click here</a>!</div>\n            \n            <noscript>Four new titles are awarded to players for completing various achievements in Talebound!<br /><br />Talebound Guide<br /><br />Talebound is a new standalone game mode in Patch 12.1.7. Players will pick one of three classes and go on a roguelite adventure starting in the town of Quillgrave. Here you'll find the Storyteller!<br /><br />Three of these titles are earned by completing Mythic difficulty on each of the three classes, while the last title is earned by completing all the stories from the Storyteller.<br /><br /><ul><li><a href=\"/achievement=63813/mythic-the-inquisitors-final-confrontation\">Mythic: The Inquisitor's Final Confrontation</a> now awards the title </li><li><a href=\"/achievement=63805/mythic-the-slayers-final-confrontation\">Mythic: The Slayer's Final Confrontation</a> now awards the title </li><li><a href=\"/achievement=63809/mythic-the-witchs-final-confrontation\">Mythic: The Witch's Final Confrontation</a> now awards the title </li><li><a href=\"/achievement=64139/stories-to-share\">Stories to Share</a> now awards the title </li></ul><br /><br />We don't know much about Talebound, as it has not been tested on the Patch 12.1.7 PTR. It's unclear exactly how hard Mythic difficulty will be until the game mode is tested or goes live. If you want to check out the Talebound Talent tree, make sure to <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/talebound-talent-calculator\">click here</a>!</noscript>            \n        ",
