    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6adb896625d429.59456576\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">A recent hotfix has changed the item level of gear after you use Ascended Venomstones on it. <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/guide/midnight/bonus-rolls-item-upgrades\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Ascendant Venomstones</span><span class=\"wh-button-icon zam-button-icon\"><img src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_1205_voidforge_sovereignvoidcorefragments_green.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></a></div><br><br>Players can use 10 <a class=\"q4 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/item=280562/ascendant-venomstone\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Ascendant Venomstone\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_1205_voidforge_sovereignvoidcorefragments_green.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Ascendant Venomstone</span></a> on certain pieces of gear to increase its item level. Earlier in the week, a crafted piece of gear gained 7 item levels to 338, while a non-crafted piece of gear gained 6 item levels to 340.<br><br>This has just been hotfixed and the amount of item levels a piece gains has changed.<ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Crafted Piece gains 6 item levels to Item level 337.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Non-Crafted piece gains 7 item levels to Item Level 341.</div></li></ul><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"markup-table-wrapper\"><table class=\"exclude-units grid\" style=\"width: 600px; max-width: 100%;\"><tbody data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>Gear Type</b></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>Previous Myth Item Level</b></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">New Myth Item Level</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\">Crafted</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">338</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">337</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\">Non-Crafted</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">340</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">341</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><br><br>While this likely doesn't change much in the grand scheme of things, non-crafted gear gained a little more power over crafted gear.</div>\n            \n            <noscript>A recent hotfix has changed the item level of gear after you use Ascended Venomstones on it. <br /><br />Ascendant Venomstones<br /><br />Players can use 10 <a href=\"/item=280562/ascendant-venomstone\">Ascendant Venomstone</a> on certain pieces of gear to increase its item level. Earlier in the week, a crafted piece of gear gained 7 item levels to 338, while a non-crafted piece of gear gained 6 item levels to 340.<br /><br />This has just been hotfixed and the amount of item levels a piece gains has changed. <br /><ul><li>Crafted Piece gains 6 item levels to Item level 337.</li><li>Non-Crafted piece gains 7 item levels to Item Level 341.</li></ul><br /><br /><table><br /><tr><td><b>Gear Type</b></td><td><b>Previous Myth Item Level</b></td><td>New Myth Item Level</td></tr><br /><tr><td>Crafted</td><td>338</td><td>337</td></tr><br /><tr><td>Non-Crafted</td><td>340</td><td>341</td></tr><br /></table><br /><br />While this likely doesn't change much in the grand scheme of things, non-crafted gear gained a little more power over crafted gear.</noscript>            \n        ",
